{
  "title": "83 Daily Life - Using The ATM",
  "audio": "./assets/englishpod_C0083pb.mp3",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Hello everyone, welcome back to another great lesson here with us at EnglishPod.",
      "trans": "大家好，欢迎再次来到这里，与我们学习英语的课程。",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.5200000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "My name is Marco and I'm Erica and today we're going to be getting money.",
      "trans": "我的名字是马科，我是埃里克，今天我们将讨论钱。",
      "start": 7.5200000000000005,
      "end": 11.76
    },
    {
      "text": "That's right.",
      "trans": "没错。",
      "start": 11.76,
      "end": 12.76
    },
    {
      "text": "We're going to have a lesson about the ATM, the ATM or automatic teller machine.",
      "trans": "我们将在课堂上学习自动取款机、ATM 或其他自助银行设备。",
      "start": 12.76,
      "end": 18.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, that's what it stands for.",
      "trans": "好的，这就是它代表的了。",
      "start": 18.76,
      "end": 20.84
    },
    {
      "text": "ATM.",
      "trans": "[Conn Error]",
      "start": 20.84,
      "end": 21.84
    },
    {
      "text": "So we're going to be looking at the language that you'll probably find in an ATM maybe",
      "trans": "所以我们将要关注你可能在ATM上看到的语言。",
      "start": 21.84,
      "end": 26.16
    },
    {
      "text": "in the United States or in English speaking country.",
      "trans": "在中华人民共和国或英语国家。",
      "start": 26.16,
      "end": 29.44
    },
    {
      "text": "That's right.",
      "trans": "没错。",
      "start": 29.44,
      "end": 30.44
    },
    {
      "text": "But before we begin, why don't we look at some vocabulary that we'll hear in the dialogue.",
      "trans": "但是，我们先看看我们在对话中会听到的一些词汇。",
      "start": 30.44,
      "end": 35.120000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "词汇预览。",
      "start": 35.120000000000005,
      "end": 37.2
    },
    {
      "text": "As we mentioned, the ATM or automatic teller machine is a machine where you get your money,",
      "trans": "根据我们之前讨论的，自动取款机或自助银行是您把钱拿走的地方。",
      "start": 37.2,
      "end": 43.52
    },
    {
      "text": "right?",
      "trans": "是的。",
      "start": 43.52,
      "end": 44.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 44.52,
      "end": 45.52
    },
    {
      "text": "And also, well, some people or in different places, they may call it the bank machine.",
      "trans": "而且，还有些人或在不同地方，他们可能会称它为银行机。",
      "start": 45.52,
      "end": 49.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, or maybe the cash machine or just a money machine or something.",
      "trans": "是的，或者可能是自动取款机或只是简单的钱箱。",
      "start": 49.2,
      "end": 54.52
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的，以下是“所有好”的翻译：",
      "start": 54.52,
      "end": 55.52
    },
    {
      "text": "So ATM.",
      "trans": "所以 ATM。",
      "start": 55.52,
      "end": 56.52
    },
    {
      "text": "ATM.",
      "trans": "[Conn Error]",
      "start": 56.52,
      "end": 57.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's take a look at our next word.",
      "trans": "让我们看看我们的下一个词。",
      "start": 57.52,
      "end": 60.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Local authorities.",
      "trans": "本地当局。",
      "start": 60.28,
      "end": 61.68000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "The local authorities.",
      "trans": "本地当局。",
      "start": 61.68000000000001,
      "end": 63.120000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "The local authorities.",
      "trans": "本地当局。",
      "start": 63.120000000000005,
      "end": 64.52000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "So what are the local authorities?",
      "trans": "所以，当地政府部门？",
      "start": 64.52000000000001,
      "end": 67.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, basically it's the police.",
