      "end": 70.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 70.56,
      "end": 71.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, authority is the person in charge, right?",
      "trans": "是的，权威是负责的人，对吗？",
