      "end": 81.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 81.08,
      "end": 82.08000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "So the police.",
      "trans": "所以警察。",
      "start": 82.08000000000001,
      "end": 83.08000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "The local authorities.",
      "trans": "本地当局。",
      "start": 83.08000000000001,
      "end": 84.08000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "So why don't we start now with our dialogue.",
      "trans": "所以，我们为什么不从对话开始呢？",
      "start": 84.08000000000001,
      "end": 86.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Why are we talking about local authorities and ATM machines?",
