      "start": 86.04,
      "end": 89.24000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know.",
      "trans": "我也不知道。",
      "start": 89.24000000000001,
      "end": 90.24000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "We got to listen to find out.",
      "trans": "我们来听听，看看。",
      "start": 90.24000000000001,
      "end": 97.24000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Stupid girl making me spend so much money.",
