      "start": 97.24000000000001,
      "end": 108.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Now I have to get it from the ATM.",
      "trans": "现在我必须从ATM取款。",
      "start": 108.56,
      "end": 111.32000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Hello.",
