      "text": "Please type the amount you would like to withdraw.",
      "trans": "请告诉我您想要取款的金额。",
      "start": 133.16,
      "end": 138.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "trans": "谢谢。",
      "start": 138.84,
      "end": 139.76
    },
    {
      "text": "You want to transfer.",
