      "start": 158.64000000000001,
      "end": 159.64000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Give me my money.",
      "trans": "请给我我的钱。",
      "start": 159.64000000000001,
      "end": 160.64000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Danger.",
      "trans": "危险。",
      "start": 160.64000000000001,
      "end": 161.64000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Danger.",
      "trans": "危险。",
      "start": 161.64000000000001,
      "end": 162.64000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "The exits have been sealed.",
      "trans": "出口已经被封堵。",
      "start": 162.64000000000001,
      "end": 164.64000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "And the doors will remain locked until the local authorities arrive.",
      "trans": "并且大门将永远锁闭，直到当地当局到来。",
      "start": 164.64000000000001,
      "end": 169.32000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for using our bank.",
