    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 192.36,
      "end": 193.36
    },
    {
      "text": "So, well, we saw some of the language that was related to an ATM money and banking.",
      "trans": "所以，嗯，我们看到了一些与ATM钱和银行相关的语言。",
      "start": 193.36,
      "end": 198.4
    },
    {
      "text": "So why don't we take a look at that now in language takeaway?",
