      "trans": "语言小贴士。",
      "start": 204.0,
      "end": 206.0
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的，以下是“所有好”的翻译：",
      "start": 206.0,
      "end": 207.0
    },
    {
      "text": "So the guy had to insert his card into the slot.",
