      "end": 211.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 211.12,
      "end": 212.12
    },
    {
      "text": "So, slot.",
      "trans": "所以，槽。",
      "start": 212.12,
      "end": 213.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Slot.",
      "trans": "在中文中，\"slot\" 的意思是 \"空位\" 或 \"空闲\"。例如：",
      "start": 213.12,
      "end": 214.12
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 214.12,
      "end": 215.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Slot.",
      "trans": "在中文中，\"slot\" 的意思是 \"空位\" 或 \"空闲\"。例如：",
      "start": 215.12,
      "end": 216.12
    },
    {
      "text": "And that is an opening, right?",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“这是个开端，对吗？”",
      "start": 216.12,
      "end": 217.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Or a type of hole, maybe.",
      "trans": "或者是一种洞，也许。",
      "start": 217.72,
      "end": 219.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 219.12,
      "end": 220.12
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a hole that is usually longed.",
      "trans": "这是一个通常被期望的洞。",
      "start": 220.12,
      "end": 221.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Longed.",
      "trans": "长了。",
      "start": 221.52,
      "end": 222.52
    },
    {
      "text": "And it's like a rectangular hole.",
      "trans": "而且就像一个矩形的洞。",
      "start": 222.52,
      "end": 224.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 224.36,
      "end": 225.36
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a slot is never a circle.",
