      "end": 226.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 226.56,
      "end": 227.56
    },
    {
      "text": "So, for example, when you get mail, the mailman will put it into your mailbox through the",
      "trans": "所以，例如，当你收到邮件时，邮差会把邮件放入你的邮箱。",
      "start": 227.56,
      "end": 231.6
    },
    {
      "text": "slot.",
      "trans": "在中文中，\"slot\" 的意思是 \"空位\" 或 \"空闲位置\"。例如：",
      "start": 231.6,
      "end": 232.6
    },
    {
      "text": "That's right.",
      "trans": "没错。",
      "start": 232.6,
      "end": 233.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 233.6,
      "end": 234.6
    },
    {
      "text": "And now that he put his card into the slot, he had to input a six digit pin code.",
      "trans": "现在，他把他的卡片插入了插槽，必须输入一个六位数的密码。",
      "start": 234.6,
      "end": 240.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Wanna just do both together?",
      "trans": "你想同时做这两件事吗？",
      "start": 240.84,
      "end": 242.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Digit and pin code?",
      "trans": "数字和密码？",
      "start": 242.72,
      "end": 243.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 243.72,
      "end": 244.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 244.72,
      "end": 245.72
    },
    {
      "text": "So a six digit pin code.",
      "trans": "所以，六位数字的密码。",
