      "end": 246.72
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 246.72,
      "end": 247.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Now we have two words here that are new.",
      "trans": "现在我们有两个新词在这里。",
      "start": 247.72,
      "end": 249.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Digit.",
      "trans": "在中文中，\"digit\" 通常翻译为 \"数字\"。如果你需要更具体的解释或使用场景，请告诉我！",
      "start": 249.44,
      "end": 250.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Digit is basically a number between zero and nine.",
      "trans": "数字基本上是一个介于零和九之间的数。",
      "start": 250.44,
      "end": 253.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 253.68,
      "end": 254.68
    },
    {
      "text": "So, any number between zero and nine is considered a digit.",
      "trans": "所以，任何数从零到九都被视为数字。",
      "start": 254.68,
      "end": 257.71999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 257.71999999999997,
      "end": 258.71999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "So, 100 is made up of three digits.",
      "trans": "所以，100是由三个数字组成的。",
      "start": 258.71999999999997,
