    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 261.72,
      "end": 262.72
    },
    {
      "text": "And what about pin code?",
      "trans": "And 什么密码？",
      "start": 262.72,
      "end": 265.04
    },
    {
