      "end": 715.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Terrible.",
      "trans": "糟糕。",
      "start": 715.88,
      "end": 716.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sure everyone has some experience or some inconvenience with ATM machines.",
      "trans": "我保证每个人都有在ATM机上遇到过或遇到了一些不便。",
      "start": 716.88,
      "end": 723.12
    },
    {
      "text": "So why don't you come to our website and tell us all about it.",
